  "note": "From the Jefferson County Clerk's November 3, 2026 county-wide sample ballot and notice of election; name capitalization follows the County Clerk's candidate filings list. Jefferson County (23rd Judicial Circuit) elects circuit and associate circuit judges on a partisan ballot. Missouri Supreme Court retention, statewide offices and statewide amendments/propositions are shown in the Missouri state section. Not shown because they depend on where you live: County Council Districts 1, 3, 5 and 7, U.S. House districts 3 and 8, state Senate and House districts, and school district questions (Hillsboro R-3 Proposition H, Meramec Valley R-III Proposition K). The sample ballot lists no countywide question and no Hillsboro or Arnold city question. Check your official sample ballot. Incumbent flags come from the county's Auditor, Prosecuting Attorney, Recorder of Deeds and Circuit Clerk pages and the retention format; other incumbents were not confirmed on an official roster.",
